Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,either will I'm feeling alive,\Nlook out below, wake up sunshine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high,\Nhail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky, time\Nto journey on, on your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come aboard with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll make some waves!.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a winner!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so bad just at first?.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, feel it's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up sunshine, here we go!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed?.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling\Nalive, look out below!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For some unknown purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,there were three powerful entities\Nthat could destroy this entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They were ancient\Nweapons named after gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pluton, Uranus, and Poseidon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And one of those great\Nweapons is the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.14,0:03:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's the case, we can't\Nlet anyone else know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If we did,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the government and every other organization\Nwould want Shirahoshi for themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,not to mention other pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong enough to destroy the whole world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To think I was just going to take off\Nafter stealing all the silly trinkets!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How foolish of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost overlooked the most\Nvaluable item they've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That mermaid princess is more\Nprecious than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you sit here stuffing your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you aware of all that's\Nbeen happening in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where you getting that, Jinbei?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you're completely uninformed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a problem, but I\Ncan't say I'm shocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.78,0:04:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought you more pets, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take this one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys left the party, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to sober up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I drank too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I ate too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji flirted too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is so magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so many babes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Chalaka, Inu, and Aokiji\Nfought each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a major event.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Rayleigh never mention this\Nto you during your training? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That was cruel of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I knew about it the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So did I do good? That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It all started two years ago,\Nright after the war ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku resigned as fleet admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aokiji was well liked among his own men,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so Sengoku nominated him\Nto take over the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But many high ranking officials favored\NAka Inu, so he became a contender as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Aokiji is normally cool tempered,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was quite adamant in\Nhis disapproval of Aka Inu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He found him unfit for the position,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so it did not take long\Nfor the disagreement
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to come to blows on an island somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the first and final\Nbattle between the two admirers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It was agreed that whoever lost would\Nwithdraw his candidacy without protest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and the winner would become.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the leader of the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:06:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As the rest of the world now knows,\Nthey fought for 10 whole days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The two opponents were equally matched\Nin power, But the duel finally ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Akainu, or as some know him,\NSakazuki, emerged victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard won!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm putting an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So did he kill Aokiji?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, both admirals were severely injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, Aokiji couldn't\Neven stand after it was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Akainu was strangely\Nmerciful towards him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite this, Aokiji refused\Nto accept the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He has resigned from the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Aokiji would\Njust up and quit like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's been going\Nthrough his mind since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The government has certainly\Nlost a valuable asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They have found ways to\Novercompensate in Aokiji's absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One might argue that they're\Nmore dangerous than ever now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There is still much you do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you reach the new world,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you must be aware of two key\Nchanges that have occurred there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, the first matter, as\NI've already begun to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,is that the Navy under Fleet Admiral\NSakazuki is stronger than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And secondly, the Blackbeard Pirates\Nare making strides of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the ones we met back in Mocktown?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They attacked my homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Straw Hat, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent many years as a member\Nof the Whitebeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He was already familiar\Nwith the territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so after their captain died,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard wasted no time in\Nseizing control of it for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the Tremor Fruit he\Nstole upon Whitebeard's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,he's gaining quite the reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,along with shanks kaido and big mom he's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Joined the ranks of the four emperors, so\Nhe stole Whitebeard's Devil Fruit and his
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,title talk about a scumbag i agree his\Naudacity is infuriating there's a rumor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,going around that they're currently on the\Nhunt for those with Devil Fruit powers i
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,am not sure how it's possible but it seems\Nthey found a way to acquire abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,from the other people upon killing them\Nclearly they plan to usurp the strongest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,powers they can find and become unstoppable\Nbe on your guard no they're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,take mine the human human fruit i think\Nyou're safe i worry for you the most luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there's a great deal of\Nbad blood between you and teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You must take care
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be the captain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain needs to have at\Nleast some idea of the situation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's okay. Gene Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of us heard you Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the captain was supposed to\Ngoof off while the crew looks out for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A good captain dedicates his\Nlife to the safety of his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.32,0:09:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather take my chances\Nand see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more fun that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't envy you all one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The party's for you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are all you guys hiding out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Weepy Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.98,0:09:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She left?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She was tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All the excitement made her need a\Nlittle nap, so she went up to her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on. Zoro? Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like there's\Nsome kind of monster here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I feel it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You cut me to the quick, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't do
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,anything to cause you pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,my dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I was ready to settle for just the treasure\Nafter selling off the other mermaids;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,turned out to be a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you might just be an exception?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then I want you to be a good girl\Nand go to sleep for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just received word from my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He and the crew have made port on\Nfish man island We're all headed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to the new world and we'd like\Nfor you to come along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now now show me a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.28,0:11:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy was still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That was scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you lucky bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have kicked him\Nwhile I had the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We really can't thank you enough, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal that\Nruffian who stole from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he was still nearby\NThis place is usually locked up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,so tight even a guppy can't get in\Nbut with everything that's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we left it open and look that big
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,tower over there has\Nbeen sliced clean in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The robber must have done it\Nwhile we were out in the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.48,0:12:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, actually that\Nwould be this guy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have seen him\Nwhen they got out of the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,cage He was hacking and\Nslashing all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.88,0:12:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn to keep your mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid starfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't say something\Nthat makes me an accomplice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, righty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a question
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Righty you mentioned a\Ntreasure thief right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes You heard correctly that\Nunsavory man who is just here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,snuck into the palace and robbed\Nus blind really well then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna let him steal national treasures\Nnow that my people are safe from harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I care nothing for material riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.50,0:12:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so you're saying you\Ndon't want them anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can rescue them,\Nyou're free to keep them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.52,0:12:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the least I can do for our heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiots just had to kick\Nhim into next week, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you just knock him\Nout and tie him up in the tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami, you're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go catch him and bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your majesty, it's hoarding his men, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Their handcuffs came off. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think we've forgotten our grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll exact our revenge soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your head will be the first to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him to my cell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof, my back hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure could use a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I age myself on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get back at the Straw Hats,\Nbut my energy's at an old time low soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't show them an ounce of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world has happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Heart and his crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You think these guys can hold me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break them and -
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they so brittle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That energy steroid you were\Ntaking to make yourself stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the pill from inside the tamate box!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're one and the same, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, tamate box?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A priceless artifact passed\Ndown for generations, Jamal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The pills hidden inside were\Nhighly valuable as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but ten years ago someone\Nstole them from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We failed to catch the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.26,0:15:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty was concerned that a scandal\Nmight break out, so we closed the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Heart, I think that happened\Naround the same time you left the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what's happened to my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Need me to spill it out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The pills were treasured. Air logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth behind their\Npurpose, lost long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tales of Their power and\Nthe curse that accompanied
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,them were both passed\Ndown merely as legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But still enough to make us wary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear that our\Ndiscretion was warranted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,However
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the tomate box was carefully\Nguarded for the safety of our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This result is truly regrettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had not allowed your judgment to\Nbe clouded by foolish dreams of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,you would not have subjected\Nyourselves to this terrible fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, they'll never\Nget their vengeance now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see the heavens have chosen us to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,settle the score and\Nthat's just what we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll not only\Nwipe out the human race
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll annihilate you\Nand your entire family!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I pity them perhaps I ought\Nto offer them clemency.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a disgrace to our\Npeople. Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,is healing now the least that you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,is refrain from speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want the children\Nhearing your poisonous words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister of the Left! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago and Mr. Pecum's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They're at the sweets factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here to collect for Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't face them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any sweets\Nfor this month's payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart and his lackeys\Ntore the factory apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.88,0:17:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the candy we\Ncould salvage was sent to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the banquet so the Straw\NHats could enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Something tells me Big Mom of the Four\NEmperors won't be satisfied with an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That a woman would level an\Nentire country for sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After much celebration, the\Nbanquet finally comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're seriously going to\Nlet us keep all that treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think Luffy and the\Nothers are all right, Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be fancy,\Nrich pirates now! Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds nice, but something tells me\Nthis is too good to be true. Hey, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go look for\Nthe treasure thief, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, how about no?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out that guy's\Nbounty is over 200 million,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:17:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's not going to be an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, and mine's only 50 berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, Sanji, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Easiest treasure hunt ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That one punch knocked him out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost feel bad for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And he left all this loot\Nsitting out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Neptune's going to let us keep all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he really is as goofy as he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How much meat do you think this will buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think his body could hold all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know he's made\Na sludge. But still.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take it back to the palace. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a flying fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way to town, Zoro? That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we could always run off with the loot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, minister of the left,\Nplease have mercy, Mr. Peckham.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:19:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart and his crew attacked the factory,\Nand now we don't have any candy left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And what makes any of that our problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to pay us some candy each\Nmonth in exchange for using Mama's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.44,0:19:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten\Nabout our little agreement?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was planning on taking\Nsome sweets for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,which means now I'm mad and hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We've done business with you for a long\Ntime, so I hate to say this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I need to remind you how\Nscary Mama can be when she's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at those cute little eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better pay up! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is the candy factory\NPapa Goo told me about. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully we can find a\Nflying fish around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the place where they\Nmake that candy I like so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, are you going\Nto give us the grand tour?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho, ho, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.56,0:20:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, is the banquet over?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.34,0:20:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, why is he here? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I totally pigged out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island's got all kinds of delicious\Nfood, but that candy was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.14,0:20:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, which day on the empty cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Mr. Catfish! What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They said candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.82,0:20:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's dry hat Luffy, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got no business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a pirate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sorry, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen here, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what candy you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can explain, Mr. Pickles. Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here for sweets, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right there with you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get enough of them, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:20:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Evaporate to say what I think he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I assure you there's\Nan explanation. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a talking lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a fluffy animal\Nguy, too. Ah, kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.28,0:21:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Threatening this monsieur will not bring\Nus any closer to the sweets, mon frere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The tea party is in four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us try to avoid a Foxy pas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If we have to wait here until\Nmorning, well, c 'est la vie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just as weird as\Nhe is. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonjour, enchanté,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,mes amis Pirates Je Zeus Baron Tamago,\NI am pleased to make your acquaintance
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamago?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oui, take care to remember\Nmy name, s 'il Vice plaît
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, excusez-moi, messieurs
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I to comprend that you have\Ndevoured all the sweets in the factory,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.58,0:22:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,my little bon vivant?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.12,0:22:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.54,0:22:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I could go for some more right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.60,0:22:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the candies\Nhave met their denouement.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Attends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the Jolly Roger of\Nour boss, Charlotte Lin-Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.64,0:22:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,also known as Big Mom\Nof the Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.34,0:22:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That symbol indicates that this\Nisland is Mama's territory, d'acord?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, mama owns the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means fishman island is\Nunder big mom's protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a nice thing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.32,0:22:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I like your boss already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.54,0:22:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda weird name, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Au contraire, mon ami.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a business deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We allow them the protection\Nof our mark And in exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.70,0:23:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,they have to pay Mama 10\Ntons of sweets every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.24,0:23:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot. Oui, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing in this world\NMama loves more than sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama says sweets from Fishman Island\Nare like creme de la creme, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay up tomorrow, and\Nwe will bid you adieu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.02,0:23:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir, but I told you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.44,0:23:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The machinery used to make\Nthe candy was badly damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take us at least two\Nweeks to make the repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.50,0:23:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be ready tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not our problem,\Nmonsieur. Hey, fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you just wait a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.14,0:23:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why doesn't your boss have the\Nballs to come talk to us himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the four emperors, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.82,0:23:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, your manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Our leader happens to be a madame\Npirate and a fearsome one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, I do not think Mama\Nhas the balls. It's a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.20,0:23:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's different, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.54,0:23:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I love sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.98,0:23:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't resist the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:24:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And I really love men who can make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what if your boss\Nlady doesn't get her candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.14,0:24:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.76,0:24:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The deal is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.86,0:24:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The big mom parrots will attack on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.02,0:24:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can say so long and\Nbonsoir to this island miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.52,0:24:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to destroy the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.80,0:24:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How crazy can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.70,0:24:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that over\Nsome stupid candies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.04,0:24:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.58,0:24:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We just saved this place, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem so happy, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.70,0:25:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's only four days\Nuntil the tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.14,0:25:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finally be able to taste those\Ndelectable candies from Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.78,0:25:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited. My stomach is already\Nproducing all the acid I'll need.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.22,0:25:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy, candy, Fishman Island candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.64,0:25:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you are all excited too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.92,0:25:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.46,0:25:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the best candy there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.70,0:25:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then wait for them in my stomach, because\Nthat's where they're all going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.82,0:25:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.28,0:25:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.70,0:25:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.94,0:26:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.92,0:26:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bobbin, how did your mission go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.60,0:26:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I set the whole place on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.66,0:26:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.28,0:26:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That country's baked goods\Nwere the best in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.48,0:26:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it smelled so\Ndelicious as it burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.02,0:26:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame we had to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.70,0:26:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But they should have honored our agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.80,0:26:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.68,0:26:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If they can't pay in sweets,\Nthey pay with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.06,0:26:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one thing I can't\Nstand. It's a broken promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.00,0:26:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That, and bitter candy, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me, apparently Fishman\NIsland can't send their payment right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.22,0:26:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckholms just told me all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.26,0:26:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I burn that down, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.52,0:27:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my Fishman Island sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.68,0:27:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get those fools on the\NTransponder Snail now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.78,0:27:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told Mama Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably calling in to check on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.46,0:27:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.14,0:27:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Big Mom, she's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.58,0:27:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You talk to her, Egghead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.12,0:27:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She isn't going to like this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.68,0:27:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.76,0:27:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.18,0:27:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Big Mom, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.52,0:27:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.22,0:28:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't sound like Tamago or Peccoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.02,0:28:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.48,0:28:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.62,0:28:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon to be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.68,0:28:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Was all that really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.12,0:28:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.44,0:28:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.04,0:28:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey... D?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.72,0:28:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must be Garp's grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.88,0:28:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember you, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.20,0:28:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the little upstart who\Ninterfered with the war two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.28,0:28:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no more candy! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.06,0:28:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't send you any!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.72,0:28:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So I heard correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to have ten tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I eat it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.98,0:28:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone now! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.22,0:29:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you lie to me?\NYou stupid child, you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.34,0:29:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,better not be covering\Nfor those weak fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying it was all me I didn't\Nknow they were supposed to be for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.52,0:29:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you a deal we've\Ngot a bunch of treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.40,0:29:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,if I give it to you then\Ncan we call it even?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.56,0:29:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.02,0:29:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.93,0:29:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't eat gold and diamonds, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.54,0:29:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweets are the only treasures\Nthat mean anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.86,0:29:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.84,0:29:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those really full of treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.86,0:29:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.30,0:29:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardonnez-moi, maman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.62,0:29:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's think about it, no? City, alors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.44,0:29:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a few short days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.08,0:29:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That enfant terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.34,0:29:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Kidd, took down Dieu of\Nour allies specials, n 'est-ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.36,0:29:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.20,0:29:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We suffered a major\Nfinancial setback and we
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.56,0:29:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,could certainly start\Nthe monetary assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.24,0:29:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And no candies are your eyes\Non it, but if you ask more,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.44,0:29:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the best option is to accept the treasure\Nin lieu of sweet payments for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.30,0:30:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll only have to wait a couple of\Nweeks to collect your confections, Dorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.58,0:30:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want something sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.62,0:30:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,we can always pick up some\Nbonbons for you on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.24,0:30:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.38,0:30:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even hit yourself? Top of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.12,0:30:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you even\Nsuggest something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.30,0:30:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of poor excuse for a pirate\Ncompromises on what she wants most? Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.14,0:30:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.90,0:30:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.44,0:30:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This insolent pirate who ate\Nall my sweets intrigues me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.12,0:30:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.96,0:30:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've chosen to go against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.00,0:30:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to get my\Nrevenge on you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.22,0:30:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.06,0:30:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.40,0:30:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.46,0:30:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.62,0:30:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's chat in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.08,0:31:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She means to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.84,0:31:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.42,0:31:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got something I need\Nto settle with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.40,0:31:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I like this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.22,0:31:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too risky to trust you with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.60,0:31:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get there, I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.62,0:31:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll make Fishman\NIsland my territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.26,0:31:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Little brat.
